 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！还记得第五十四集的形容词吗？今天，我们再学一些形容动物的词。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:animals",
    "focus:animals"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "动物们："
    },
    {
     "en": "animals"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:panda",
    "edge:animals>panda",
    "focus:panda"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "中国的熊猫："
    },
    {
     "en": "panda"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:famous",
    "edge:panda>famous",
    "focus:famous"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "熊猫全世界都很有名。著名的，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "famous"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:special",
    "edge:panda>special",
    "focus:special"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "它是很特别的动物："
    },
    {
     "en": "special"
    },
    {
     "en": "Pandas are famous because they are special.",
     "cue": [
      "focus:panda,famous,special"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:treasure",
    "edge:panda>treasure",
    "focus:treasure"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "熊猫是我们国家的宝贝。宝藏、珍宝，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "treasure"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:monkey",
    "edge:animals>monkey",
    "focus:monkey"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "聪明的猴子："
    },
    {
     "en": "monkey"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:creative",
    "edge:monkey>creative",
    "focus:creative"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "猴子会想出新办法，很有创造力："
    },
    {
     "en": "creative"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wolf",
    "focus:wolf"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "狼："
    },
    {
     "en": "wolf"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:patient",
    "edge:wolf>patient",
    "focus:patient"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "狼静静地等猎物，很有耐心："
    },
    {
     "en": "patient"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:impatient",
    "edge:patient>impatient",
    "focus:impatient"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "前面加上 i m，就是没耐心："
    },
    {
     "en": "impatient"
    },
    {
     "zh": "就像 un 一样，im 也让意思反过来。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:pig",
    "focus:pig"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "胖乎乎的猪："
    },
    {
     "en": "pig"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:ugly",
    "edge:pig>ugly",
    "focus:ugly"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "有人说猪很丑，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "ugly"
    },
    {
     "zh": "其实每种动物都有自己的美哦。"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:bird",
    "focus:bird"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小鸟："
    },
    {
     "en": "bird"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:pretty",
    "edge:bird>pretty",
    "focus:pretty"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "羽毛五颜六色，真漂亮："
    },
    {
     "en": "pretty"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:beautiful",
    "edge:pretty>beautiful",
    "focus:beautiful"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "比漂亮更美，是美丽的。美，加上 f u l："
    },
    {
     "en": "beauty"
    },
    {
     "en": "beautiful"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:owl",
    "focus:owl"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "夜里的猫头鹰："
    },
    {
     "en": "owl"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:silent",
    "edge:owl>silent",
    "focus:silent"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "它飞起来静悄悄的："
    },
    {
     "en": "silent"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wise",
    "edge:silent>wise",
    "focus:wise"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "人们常说猫头鹰很有智慧："
    },
    {
     "en": "wise"
    },
    {
     "en": "Owls are wise and beautiful."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:patient,impatient"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "有耐心和没耐心："
    },
    {
     "en": "patient",
     "cue": [
      "focus:patient"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "impatient",
     "cue": [
      "focus:impatient"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "最后，跟着我把今天的单词再读一遍吧！"
    }
   ]
